    "name": "Dapr Cryptography API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Dapr Cryptography API enables applications to perform cryptographic operations such as encrypting and decrypting data using configured cryptography components, without exposing cryptographic keys to the application. Supports high-level encrypt/decrypt and low-level subtle crypto operations.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Dapr",
